#D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]wire[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire: add a required `icon` string to the Rust [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`ArtifactRefProviderRefSpecWire`, validate it as a bounded [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]one-or-two-cell glyph, and cover accept/reject and digest cases in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Rust unit tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Icons, cell-accurate click ranges, and reflow-to-fit in [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]PanelTabStrip[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]strip[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip: give `PanelTab` an icon, render it between the number and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]label, measure click ranges in terminal cells instead of characters, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add an opt-in reflow ladder that keeps every tab visible and clickable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]when the strip cannot fit its full render.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Icons on Artifacts tab descriptors and in sidecar ref config[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tabs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wire[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tabs: add a built-in icon table for the four fixed panes, resolve each [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]provider pane's icon from its ref spec, accept `ref.icon` as a sidecar [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]config override, give the built-in plan provider its mark, and keep an [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]outdated provider plugin working behind a warning diagnostic.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Research sidecar ref provider icon[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #5FD7AF] xsmall [/bold black on #5FD7AF]\n    [#AF87FF]research[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wire[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]research: declare the research ref provider's icon in the sase-research [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin so the Research pane matches the research tribe mark already [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]configured there.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Render icons in the Artifacts strip, then document and [/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]re-golden[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]render[dim] · [dim][/dim]after strip, tabs[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]render: pass descriptor icons and the reflow opt-in into the Artifacts [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tab strip, update the ACE and configuration docs, extend the mechanical [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]glyph audit to the new marks, and regenerate every affected PNG golden.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-kv","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-kv.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-7a830da96311a9e27b5c27291dc73dcc","started_at":"2026-08-13T13:18:40.904252+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"b5f584b19fa27aa9dee139f24a597f1fef9acc255898d5ecb4423cad4ad9b21c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-kv.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-kv.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"986272d565cc964c61aa4e8cb34749dd93274a59c11458251952b65d8fbe26f1","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-kv.3/meta.json","size_bytes":633},"prompt":{"digest":"d4e6b5063142383e9ec1dee0449e20f426c31d661e340d029712b19a527236e5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-kv.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":148},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"a69e6c0741e308482335fc653171